  "legalSupportRow": "Help & support",
  "@legalSupportRow": {"description": "ADR-037 — account deletion, reports, rules"},
  "legalTermsIntro": "By using Sinhron you agree to these rules. They apply to everyone on this server.",
  "@legalTermsIntro": {"description": "ADR-037 — account deletion, reports, rules"},
  "legalTermsBody": "No tolerance for objectionable content or abusive people. Don’t send spam, threats, harassment, hate, sexual content involving minors, or anything illegal where you or the recipient live.\n\nReport and block. In any chat you can report a person or a message. The report goes to the operator of your server, who reviews it and may remove the account — usually within 24 hours. Blocking hides a person from you at once.\n\nYour messages are end-to-end encrypted: the operator can’t read them. A report contains only what you choose to send.\n\nThe operator may remove accounts that break these rules. You can delete your account at any time in Profile → Delete account.",
  "@legalTermsBody": {"description": "ADR-037 — account deletion, reports, rules"},
  "legalPrivacyBody": "Messages, calls, photos and files are encrypted on your devices; the server only passes them along encrypted and can’t read them.\n\nThe server knows: your Sinhron address, your devices, which groups you are in, and when messages are sent — that is what it needs to deliver them. It doesn’t know your name, photo, contacts or message content.\n\nNothing is sold or shared with advertisers. No ads, no analytics.\n\nDelete your account at any time (Profile → Delete account): the server removes your address, devices and messages waiting for you.",
  "@legalPrivacyBody": {"description": "ADR-037 — account deletion, reports, rules"},
  "legalSupportBody": "Questions, problems, a report about someone: write to the operator of your server.",
  "@legalSupportBody": {"description": "ADR-037 — account deletion, reports, rules"},
  "legalSupportOperator": "Server: {server}",
